@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {

    usecase "View Room Availability" as UC01
    usecase "Book Study Room" as UC02
    usecase "Cancel Booking" as UC03
    usecase "Block / Unblock Room" as UC04
    usecase "Review Room Usage" as UC05
    usecase "Receive Booking Confirmation" as UC06
}

Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03

Administrator --> UC04
Administrator --> UC05

' why: R4 - a successful booking always produces a confirmation, so the confirmation is part of booking, not a separate actor goal
UC02 ..> UC06 : <<include>>

@enduml
